1
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:17,950
No... A Prismer at the academy?

2
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:21,960
Wow!

3
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,660
Hey, Rani, that's a Prismer, right?

4
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,080
Yeah, it is...

5
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:30,870
It's moving! It's not like the one 
we saw in Almen that was frozen!

6
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:36,720
<i>When I was but an infant, I decided 
that I'd one day defeat a Prismer on my own.</i>

7
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,630
<i>And now here it is, right before my eyes!</i>

8
00:00:39,630 --> 00:00:44,190
<i>I'm so glad I was reborn to master the blade!</i>

9
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:48,320
To be precise, it's not fully complete yet.

10
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:50,660
It's only a matter of time.

11
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:54,800
Oh, I just don't know!

12
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:57,320
Which should I fight?

13
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:01,440
Come on, Chris! What are you thinking?

14
00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:04,350
We have to get back to 
the academy, obviously!

15
00:01:04,350 --> 00:01:06,410
Rani! B-But...

16
00:01:06,410 --> 00:01:08,380
Get going.

17
00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:12,330
This rat over here 
was my prey from the start.

18
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,340
Hey, no fair, Ivel!

19
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:17,180
No stealing my opponents!

20
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,960
That thing will be annihilated 
the moment it touches my shield!

21
00:02:14,110 --> 00:02:17,070
<u>Reborn</u>

22
00:02:14,110 --> 00:02:17,070
to Master the Blade
     From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire

23
00:02:14,110 --> 00:02:17,070
to Master the Blade
From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire

24
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:35,020
Episode 12     Clash! Hero-King vs. King of Rainbows

25
00:03:33,220 --> 00:03:35,730
This isn't good...

26
00:03:35,730 --> 00:03:38,390
What's this thing? 
Is this what they call a last boss?

27
00:03:42,690 --> 00:03:45,320
Leone! Liselotte!

28
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:48,010
Get the people who fell 
unconscious out of here!

29
00:03:48,010 --> 00:03:49,580
Yes, ma'am!

30
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:54,190
Buy me a little time!

31
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:57,990
Yua, I'll put up a barrier.

32
00:03:57,990 --> 00:04:00,120
Distract the Prismer.

33
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:04,270
I'm scared of the big guy, though...

34
00:04:03,510 --> 00:04:05,680
I will not let you talk back right now!

35
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:06,780
Go do it!

36
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:08,120
O-Okay!

37
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,480
Nice work, girlie!

38
00:04:22,290 --> 00:04:24,150
Hey, over here!

39
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:29,050
Good stuff.

40
00:04:29,050 --> 00:04:30,750
Nice work, old man.

41
00:04:30,750 --> 00:04:33,560
I'm actually still in my twenties...

42
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:36,950
The only thing to do with bad stuff 
is get it over with as soon as you can.

43
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,550
Hai-yah!

44
00:04:42,450 --> 00:04:44,520
Good! Nice punch!

45
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:46,680
Reminds me of Inglis!

46
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:49,130
No, I don't think it did anything.

47
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:51,980
Huh? Looks like you pierced 
its skin, though.

48
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:55,180
No, I'm being sucked in. Suck-suck.

49
00:04:55,420 --> 00:04:57,020
What? Seriously?

50
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:57,930
Yua!

51
00:05:00,890 --> 00:05:03,170
I surrounded her with a barrier!

52
00:05:03,170 --> 00:05:05,100
Okay, wait a second.

53
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:08,900
This'll hurt a little, 
but I'll blow that whole area away!

54
00:05:08,900 --> 00:05:10,620
ASAP, please.

55
00:05:14,150 --> 00:05:16,680
Heat beam incoming! Run, everyone!

56
00:05:22,670 --> 00:05:24,620
Brother!

57
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:25,920
Leon!

58
00:05:30,810 --> 00:05:32,080
Brother!

59
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,410
Are you okay?

60
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:35,750
I guess...

61
00:05:35,750 --> 00:05:40,540
Bastard... That armor's 
been my partner for years!

62
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:43,360
I'm kind of in trouble here...

63
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:45,310
Yua!

64
00:05:45,310 --> 00:05:46,410
No...

65
00:05:46,730 --> 00:05:48,170
She's still okay!

66
00:05:48,170 --> 00:05:49,870
The barrier's working!

67
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:52,510
She hasn't been completely absorbed!

68
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:56,060
I'll find a way to dig her out!

69
00:05:58,020 --> 00:06:00,760
Silva, how's Ripple looking?

70
00:06:02,470 --> 00:06:04,460
She's not absorbing my power anymore.

71
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:07,790
This is likely the last magicite beast.

72
00:06:07,790 --> 00:06:09,920
So we just have to survive this, then.

73
00:06:11,770 --> 00:06:14,860
Won't Ripple be waking up soon?

74
00:06:15,110 --> 00:06:18,550
If that happens, we can have her help...

75
00:06:18,550 --> 00:06:20,900
No, I wouldn't count on that.

76
00:06:21,150 --> 00:06:22,170
But why?

77
00:06:22,170 --> 00:06:25,060
This is exactly what the 
Hyral Menases are for!

78
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:28,320
She'll still be weak after what happened.

79
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:29,810
Don't make her exert herself.

80
00:06:30,450 --> 00:06:33,840
That Prismer probably isn't complete.

81
00:06:34,160 --> 00:06:36,750
Let's find another way!

82
00:06:38,730 --> 00:06:41,310
Take everyone to a pocket space 
where they'll be safe!

83
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:42,750
What will you do?

84
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,840
I'll figure things out.

85
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:49,800
If I go too, the barrier will disappear!

86
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,860
Go!

87
00:06:50,860 --> 00:06:52,120
Brother...

88
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,330
Go!

89
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:00,100
Here I go!

90
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:05,300
You're responsible for 
your own safety, okay?

91
00:07:05,670 --> 00:07:08,030
Sure thing, "ma'am."

92
00:07:09,980 --> 00:07:11,120
Here it comes!

93
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:13,080
I'll stop it!

94
00:07:14,170 --> 00:07:17,030
Chris, we have to get back to the academy!

95
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:20,330
No, the others are there already. 
They'll be fine.

96
00:07:20,330 --> 00:07:22,560
It's important to believe in your comrades!

97
00:07:26,550 --> 00:07:29,090
Good, the town's safe.

98
00:07:29,090 --> 00:07:29,640
See?

99
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:31,310
I don't see!

100
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:34,490
You girls sure make a lot of noise.

101
00:07:34,490 --> 00:07:35,750
Get back to your friends.

102
00:07:36,350 --> 00:07:39,350
We don't have time to deal with you.

103
00:07:39,350 --> 00:07:42,850
W-Wait! Please don't leave!

104
00:07:42,850 --> 00:07:44,830
I still want to fight you...

105
00:07:43,950 --> 00:07:44,830
Silence!

106
00:07:44,830 --> 00:07:48,660
I'm not here for your entertainment, 
nor am I your playmate.

107
00:07:49,610 --> 00:07:51,120
We've achieved our goal

108
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:54,050
of killing the Highlander emissary 
and taking his battleship.

109
00:07:54,050 --> 00:07:57,670
That's enough for us. We're leaving.

110
00:07:58,430 --> 00:08:01,130
It seems to be growing 
more complete by the second.

111
00:08:01,530 --> 00:08:03,750
You should hurry before it's too late.

112
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:05,650
Chris!

113
00:08:07,770 --> 00:08:09,130
I'm disappointed.

114
00:08:09,130 --> 00:08:12,050
I wanted to fight you more.

115
00:08:12,310 --> 00:08:13,870
I'll pass.

116
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:16,260
You can have that as a gift from us. Go.

117
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:18,480
I'll see you again sometime.

118
00:08:18,790 --> 00:08:20,870
I certainly hope not.

119
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:34,480
Ripple!

120
00:08:36,410 --> 00:08:39,340
Guys, you're safe...

121
00:08:39,340 --> 00:08:41,470
Not as much as you'd think.

122
00:08:42,360 --> 00:08:46,360
The last magicite beast 
summoned was a Prismer.

123
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:49,700
What? One of my comrades became a Prismer?

124
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:54,870
The principal said it wasn't 
complete yet, but...

125
00:08:54,870 --> 00:09:00,550
The principal and Leone's brother are 
staying outside the pocket space to stop it.

126
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:02,500
Leon's here?

127
00:09:02,500 --> 00:09:04,510
He came to help us.

128
00:09:04,510 --> 00:09:06,850
Even those two aren't strong enough 
to do this on their own!

129
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:09,480
Leone, can you cancel the pocket space?

130
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:11,870
Okay!

131
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,690
The school building...

132
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:20,240
Miliera! Leon! Are you okay?

133
00:09:20,970 --> 00:09:23,620
Ripple! Good timing!

134
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:25,700
You awake now, Sleeping Beauty?

135
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:30,420
We're okay for now, barely, but help 
would be more than appreciated!

136
00:09:31,470 --> 00:09:32,570
Leave it to me.

137
00:09:35,060 --> 00:09:40,170
I've caused problems for everyone... 
so now I'll protect them in turn!

138
00:09:40,170 --> 00:09:42,420
Because I'm a Hyral Menas!

139
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:45,350
Even if you were once my comrade...

140
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:47,720
No, <i>because</i> you were once my comrade...

141
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,070
I have to do this!

142
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:53,770
Wow.

143
00:09:53,770 --> 00:09:55,820
She always did know how to move.

144
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:04,220
Ripple! Get out of here!

145
00:10:07,590 --> 00:10:08,600
No!

146
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:18,470
Ripple!

147
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:21,920
No! It might hit Ripple!

148
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,380
Damn it!

149
00:10:23,650 --> 00:10:25,680
What do we do, Miliera?

150
00:10:25,680 --> 00:10:28,350
I don't know how long that barrier will last.

151
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:31,810
First, we need to get it out of the city 
before the barrier breaks

152
00:10:31,810 --> 00:10:33,790
and its beams can hit something!

153
00:10:35,970 --> 00:10:36,920
Ripple!

154
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:47,970
Ripple!

155
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:53,640
I'm fine. Hyral Menases are tough.

156
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:58,300
If you want to get it out of the city, 
I'll be the one to draw its attention.

157
00:10:58,300 --> 00:11:01,620
You need to rest. I'll do that.

158
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:04,500
Please... I need to be the one to...

159
00:11:05,690 --> 00:11:06,710
Ripple...

160
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:10,400
Please, become a weapon 
and lend me your strength!

161
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,440
I can't do that!

162
00:11:12,490 --> 00:11:16,000
I'm still in training, but I can do this!

163
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,120
Please!

164
00:11:17,770 --> 00:11:21,900
Ever since you saved me when I was a child,

165
00:11:22,370 --> 00:11:25,590
I've been training so that
I could fight with you some day!

166
00:11:26,290 --> 00:11:29,940
I became strong, just like you told me to!

167
00:11:32,020 --> 00:11:33,520
Silva...

168
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:37,680
I didn't think the little kid I saved 
would become such a strong young man...

169
00:11:38,450 --> 00:11:40,690
Time sure flies.

170
00:11:41,420 --> 00:11:43,650
I've gotten older, too, haven't I?

171
00:11:44,370 --> 00:11:47,640
You saved my life, and I want to repay you.

172
00:11:48,190 --> 00:11:50,240
The Highlanders are 
using you for their plots,

173
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:55,930
and forcing you to fight your comrades...  
and I want to protect your heart!

174
00:11:56,990 --> 00:11:59,350
Silva... But...

175
00:12:00,830 --> 00:12:02,360
Ripple?

176
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:06,000
N-No! I wasn't trying to do it!

177
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,550
Stop it, Ripple! Don't turn into a weapon!

178
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:10,330
He's still too young!

179
00:12:10,330 --> 00:12:13,500
N-No! I'm not the one who wants to do it...

180
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:15,530
His will is drawing me in!

181
00:12:26,130 --> 00:12:27,530
Ripple...

182
00:12:28,680 --> 00:12:31,190
Th-That's Ripple...

183
00:12:31,190 --> 00:12:32,850
...in the form of a weapon.

184
00:12:34,020 --> 00:12:37,390
I can feel it... Incredible power...

185
00:12:37,740 --> 00:12:40,370
With this, I can defeat anything!

186
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,990
Even a Prismer!

187
00:12:47,280 --> 00:12:49,190
Stop! Drop it!

188
00:12:49,190 --> 00:12:51,830
Silva, calm down!

189
00:12:51,830 --> 00:12:54,410
You can't let the power take control!

190
00:12:54,410 --> 00:12:56,160
You're not ready to use that!

191
00:12:56,540 --> 00:13:00,790
Ripple answered my request. 
Get out of the way.

192
00:13:01,140 --> 00:13:02,890
I said, put it down!

193
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:08,170
Don't get in my way!

194
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,660
Inglis?

195
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:28,830
Looks like I made it just in time!

196
00:13:28,830 --> 00:13:31,240
How? In what possible way?

197
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:35,860
It looks more to me like you attacked one 
of our allies before he could save the day!

198
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:38,840
Please don't break my barrier!

199
00:13:39,830 --> 00:13:42,260
Here it comes! Miliera! Rebuild the barrier!

200
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:44,040
No! There's no time!

201
00:13:44,630 --> 00:13:46,180
I'll take full responsibility!

202
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:47,970
Inglis?!

203
00:13:53,390 --> 00:13:56,800
<i>I guess I can't kick it as far as Ivel...</i>

204
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:00,010
It didn't work! It's going to fire!

205
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:03,410
That's just what I was hoping it would do!

206
00:14:04,010 --> 00:14:06,100
Come on, fire!

207
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:09,770
The beams are heading for the city...

208
00:14:09,770 --> 00:14:12,030
This is bad!

209
00:14:14,290 --> 00:14:16,380
The beams changed direction?

210
00:14:16,380 --> 00:14:19,310
Wh-What's going on?

211
00:14:19,310 --> 00:14:20,950
It's Inglis!

212
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:23,620
She's punching the beams!

213
00:14:24,010 --> 00:14:26,420
All of you, disappear into the sky!

214
00:14:28,590 --> 00:14:31,100
It's too fast to see...

215
00:14:35,160 --> 00:14:39,890
<i>In the fifteen years since I was reborn... 
have I ever been this excited?</i>

216
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:40,480
My partner's
 a Prismer!

217
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:40,520
My partner's
 a Prismer!

218
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:40,560
My partner's
 a Prismer!

219
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:40,600
My partner's
 a Prismer!

220
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:42,860
My partner's
 a Prismer!

221
00:14:40,870 --> 00:14:42,860
<i>I couldn't be happier!</i>

222
00:14:43,850 --> 00:14:47,820
Chris is definitely trying to have fun.

223
00:14:47,820 --> 00:14:51,710
Inglis! This isn't the time!

224
00:14:51,710 --> 00:14:52,860
See that light?

225
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:55,670
Yua's been absorbed inside it!

226
00:14:55,670 --> 00:14:58,350
Yua? Got it!

227
00:15:01,270 --> 00:15:05,300
<i>I'll focus my attacks around Yua 
and dig her out!</i>

228
00:15:09,460 --> 00:15:13,500
L-Look! It's faster than when it fought me!

229
00:15:13,500 --> 00:15:15,170
With a body that size...

230
00:15:15,610 --> 00:15:17,380
I can't believe it!

231
00:15:18,200 --> 00:15:20,700
<i>I need to do more than
just dodge its attacks all day.</i>

232
00:15:24,070 --> 00:15:25,270
She blocked it?

233
00:15:25,270 --> 00:15:28,970
<i>It's not just fast! There's an incredible 
weight behind each of its strikes!</i>

234
00:15:28,970 --> 00:15:30,480
<i>Wonderful!</i>

235
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:36,030
Uh, guys...

236
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:40,060
She's blocking the Prismer's punches 
and kicks with her own...

237
00:15:41,450 --> 00:15:45,020
Maybe she was really a Hyral Menas all along?

238
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:48,550
It looks like blocking is all 
she can do, though...

239
00:15:49,250 --> 00:15:51,790
<i>There's no opening for me 
to launch an attack of my own.</i>

240
00:15:52,440 --> 00:15:53,300
So...

241
00:15:55,770 --> 00:15:57,310
Aether Pierce!

242
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:00,840
Aether Strike!

243
00:16:02,380 --> 00:16:06,640
Inglis! The light of Yua's barrier 
is growing weaker!

244
00:16:06,640 --> 00:16:10,100
It's going to completely absorb her!

245
00:16:11,050 --> 00:16:13,380
<i>I have one thing that might do the trick.</i>

246
00:16:13,710 --> 00:16:18,150
<i>I have to get close to try it...</i>

247
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:20,980
<i>but it's watching for that.</i>

248
00:16:21,510 --> 00:16:22,540
Chris!

249
00:16:25,190 --> 00:16:26,420
Rani!

250
00:16:34,250 --> 00:16:36,370
Leone! Liselotte!

251
00:16:36,370 --> 00:16:38,340
We'll distract it!

252
00:16:38,340 --> 00:16:40,070
That'll be your chance!

253
00:16:40,930 --> 00:16:42,200
Here we go!

254
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:53,270
Aether Strike!

255
00:16:55,230 --> 00:16:58,960
Even you can't dodge in mid-air!

256
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:01,160
<i>That's what I've been waiting for!</i>

257
00:17:10,340 --> 00:17:12,240
It's working!

258
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:15,520
The rainbow-colored skin 
is taking damage, too!

259
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:18,680
Go! Blow it away!

260
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:20,480
No!

261
00:17:20,730 --> 00:17:25,430
Hang in there! Stand strong! 
You can take this!

262
00:17:27,320 --> 00:17:28,350
Chris!

263
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:29,810
Inglis!

264
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:33,170
Go!

265
00:17:33,170 --> 00:17:36,690
Aether Breaker!

266
00:18:05,430 --> 00:18:06,870
Is it over?

267
00:18:07,430 --> 00:18:10,390
The Prismer... is defeated?

268
00:18:10,390 --> 00:18:12,440
Wh-Where's Inglis?

269
00:18:12,890 --> 00:18:14,160
She's fine!

270
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:22,690
I worked up a nice sweat today!

271
00:18:23,420 --> 00:18:25,380
Hooray!

272
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:27,610
I'm so glad!

273
00:18:27,610 --> 00:18:30,330
You did it, Inglis!

274
00:18:30,330 --> 00:18:32,230
Nice work, Inglis!

275
00:18:32,230 --> 00:18:33,290
You're the best!

276
00:18:33,290 --> 00:18:37,580
I thought for a moment that when 
it disappeared, it took Yua with it.

277
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:39,600
I'm amazed you were able to save her.

278
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:42,480
I pulled her out while I was 
piercing through the Prismer.

279
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:46,420
That new technique is the 
strongest you've ever used!

280
00:18:46,420 --> 00:18:50,000
They're gonna let us eat free at the 
cafeteria for even longer now, Chris!

281
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:52,120
Is that true, ma'am?

282
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:55,120
Y-Yes, of course it is!

283
00:18:57,550 --> 00:18:59,760
I'm starving after all that fighting!

284
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:00,690
So let's go!

285
00:19:01,740 --> 00:19:02,720
Huh?

286
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,130
Where's the cafeteria?

287
00:19:04,130 --> 00:19:06,120
It got blown up.

288
00:19:06,120 --> 00:19:10,170
You can eat your fill when it's rebuilt.

289
00:19:13,670 --> 00:19:16,960
Several Days Later

290
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,810
Hey, you there.

291
00:19:21,090 --> 00:19:23,180
Stop slacking, and work.

292
00:19:23,180 --> 00:19:25,990
You didn't do anything 
when the big guy showed up.

293
00:19:25,990 --> 00:19:28,430
So you should do all the work here.

294
00:19:29,410 --> 00:19:33,540
I would've beaten the Prismer 
if I hadn't been interrupted!

295
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,930
You don't believe me, do you?

296
00:19:36,470 --> 00:19:41,410
And what happened to the two girls who want 
the cafeteria back more than anything?

297
00:19:41,650 --> 00:19:44,670
They said they were going to the royal court.

298
00:19:44,670 --> 00:19:48,250
The king summoned them himself!

299
00:19:51,210 --> 00:19:54,410
Did you see what happened 
when I turned into a weapon?

300
00:19:54,410 --> 00:19:56,420
Yeah. That could've been a big problem.

301
00:19:56,420 --> 00:19:59,100
So you knew what you were doing 
when you stopped him.

302
00:19:59,710 --> 00:20:02,880
If Silva had fired...

303
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:08,360
We would've paid a heavy price 
for defeating the Prismer.

304
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:14,460
I don't know how I would've been able 
to face everyone after that.

305
00:20:14,460 --> 00:20:18,680
That's how the relationship between a holy 
knight and a Hyral Menas works, right?

306
00:20:20,010 --> 00:20:24,780
I finally understand why Eris got 
so agitated when she met Rani.

307
00:20:26,570 --> 00:20:29,070
Chris! I'm all ready!

308
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:33,400
Don't tell Rafinha that.

309
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,150
Of course.

310
00:20:37,340 --> 00:20:40,690
Thank you both so much for your help.

311
00:20:40,690 --> 00:20:42,090
You have my deepest gratitude.

312
00:20:42,390 --> 00:20:45,170
Your words honor us, sire.

313
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:47,140
Especially you, Inglis.

314
00:20:47,140 --> 00:20:52,890
You defeated the Highlander Arch Lord alone 
and drove away the Bloodchain Brigade.

315
00:20:53,250 --> 00:20:56,170
The judgment and decisiveness you showed

316
00:20:56,170 --> 00:20:59,410
make you truly worthy 
to lead my country's knights.

317
00:20:59,410 --> 00:21:01,850
I'm honored... Huh?

318
00:21:01,850 --> 00:21:10,460
Inglis Eucus, I hereby declare you 
the new head of the Royal Guard.

319
00:21:11,530 --> 00:21:14,520
You're making Chris the head 
of the Royal Guard?

320
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:15,530
But...

321
00:21:15,770 --> 00:21:20,870
Your power rivals that of a 
Hyral Menas or holy knight.

322
00:21:21,140 --> 00:21:23,840
None could be better suited for the job.

323
00:21:24,380 --> 00:21:26,850
Congratulations, Lady Inglis!

324
00:21:26,850 --> 00:21:28,910
Please become our leader!

325
00:21:28,910 --> 00:21:32,810
Sure, Chris is strong, and decisive...

326
00:21:33,260 --> 00:21:39,790
<i>But... this means Chris won't 
be with me anymore, right?</i>

327
00:21:39,790 --> 00:21:43,850
<i>I should be happy she's getting 
an offer like this, though!</i>

328
00:21:43,850 --> 00:21:45,890
<i>I have to be happy for her...</i>

329
00:21:45,890 --> 00:21:48,030
<i>But... But...</i>

330
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:53,990
It's an honor, truly, but I must refuse.

331
00:21:53,990 --> 00:21:55,940
Whaaa?

332
00:21:55,940 --> 00:21:58,030
Wh-What?

333
00:22:04,180 --> 00:22:06,530
You're sure about this, Chris?

334
00:22:06,530 --> 00:22:10,760
I already decided to always be by your side.
So it doesn't bother me at all.

335
00:22:10,760 --> 00:22:14,680
You're saying that, but the real 
reason is that the commander

336
00:22:14,680 --> 00:22:18,970
doesn't get a lot of chances to 
fight on the front lines, right?

337
00:22:19,940 --> 00:22:21,020
You could tell, huh?

338
00:22:22,190 --> 00:22:25,360
Chris, let's be friends forever, okay?

339
00:22:25,700 --> 00:22:28,140
Yeah, let's do our best together, Rani!

340
00:22:29,380 --> 00:22:31,120
Now, let's go home.

341
00:22:31,120 --> 00:22:32,250
Yeah.

342
00:22:32,250 --> 00:22:33,970
Wait, you two.

343
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:37,160
We're not done talking yet.

344
00:22:41,310 --> 00:22:46,390
I wanted to bring you here 
to thank you for your efforts yesterday.

345
00:22:46,390 --> 00:22:50,430
This feast was actually intended to celebrate
Inglis's appointment as commander, but yeah.

346
00:22:50,740 --> 00:22:53,950
You're not going to turn 
this down too, are you?

347
00:22:53,950 --> 00:22:56,360
Not at all, Your Majesty!

348
00:22:56,360 --> 00:22:58,640
We accept with pleasure!

349
00:22:58,640 --> 00:22:59,890
Now, let's both say it together...

350
00:22:59,890 --> 00:23:02,370
Meat!

351
00:23:45,940 --> 00:23:50,940
Comic by Kuromura Moto

